1
00:04:02,608 --> 00:04:08,608
Worlds will live, worlds will die and nothing will ever be the same.

2
00:08:05,217 --> 00:08:11,217
Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths Part One is a animation,
science fiction, action film directed by Jeff Wamester.

3
00:12:07,826 --> 00:12:13,826
Death is coming.

4
00:16:10,434 --> 00:16:16,434
Worse than death: oblivion.

5
00:20:13,043 --> 00:20:19,043
Not just for our Earth, but for everyone, everywhere, in every universe!

6
00:24:15,652 --> 00:24:21,652
Against this ultimate destruction, the mysterious Monitor has
gathered the greatest team of Super Heroes ever assembled.

7
00:28:18,260 --> 00:28:24,260
But what can the combined might of Superman, Wonder Woman, Batman, The Flash, Green Lantern and hundreds of Super
Heroes from multiple Earths even do to save all of reality from an unstoppable antimatter armageddon?!

8
00:32:20,869 --> 00:32:26,869
The Flash / Barry Allen (voice), played by Matt Bomer.

9
00:36:23,478 --> 00:36:29,478
Batman / Bruce Wayne (voice), played by Jensen Ackles.

10
00:40:26,086 --> 00:40:32,086
Superman / Earth-2 Superman (voice), played by Darren Criss.

11
00:44:28,695 --> 00:44:34,695
Supergirl / Harbinger (voice), played by Meg Donnelly.

12
00:48:31,304 --> 00:48:37,304
Wonder Woman / Superwoman (voice), played by Stana Katic.

13
00:52:33,913 --> 00:52:39,913
Green Arrow (voice), played by Jimmi Simpson.

14
00:56:36,521 --> 00:56:42,521
Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths is a 2024 American animated superhero film trilogy featuring the DC Comics superhero team the Justice
League and based on the DC Comics storyline Crisis on Infinite Earths (1985–1986) written by Marv Wolfman and pencilled by George Pérez.

15
01:00:39,130 --> 01:00:45,130
The films were directed by Jeff Wamester from a script by Jim Krieg.

16
01:04:41,739 --> 01:04:47,739
They are the 54th, 55th, and 56th films of the DC
Universe Animated Original Movies.

17
01:08:44,347 --> 01:08:50,347
They are the eighth, ninth, and tenth (and final) installments in the second phase of the DC
Animated Movie Universe, as well as the 23rd, 24th, and 25th (and final) films overall.

18
01:12:46,956 --> 01:12:52,956
Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths – Part
One was released on January 9, 2024.

19
01:16:49,565 --> 01:16:55,565
Part Two was released on April 23, and Part Three was released on July 16.

20
01:20:52,173 --> 01:20:58,173
The films were dedicated to comic artist George Pérez who died on May 6, 2022, and
longtime Batman actor Kevin Conroy who died later that same year on November 10.

21
01:24:54,782 --> 01:25:00,782
The film explores themes of superhero, villain, end of the
world, based on graphic novel, superhero team.

22
01:28:57,391 --> 01:29:03,391
The tone is thought_provoking.
